stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Closed

    Closed --> Loading: Click Export button
    Loading --> TreeReady: Features loaded
    Loading --> Error: Load failed

    state TreeReady {
        [*] --> NoneSelected
        NoneSelected --> SomeSelected: Check a diagram/feature
        SomeSelected --> NoneSelected: Uncheck all
        SomeSelected --> AllSelected: Check all
        AllSelected --> SomeSelected: Uncheck one
        SomeSelected --> SomeSelected: Toggle item
    }

    TreeReady --> Generating: Click Download\n(requires SomeSelected or AllSelected)
    Generating --> Downloading: HTML generated
    Generating --> Error: Generation failed

    Downloading --> Closed: Download complete
    Error --> TreeReady: Dismiss error
    TreeReady --> Closed: Click close / backdrop
    Error --> Closed: Click close
